<Base title="About" description="A managed-services company in Canada — 10–20 specialists across seven practices.">
<section><div class="container"><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>A managed-services company, not a design shop.</h1>
<p style="max-width:760px">We are a team of 10–20 specialists based in Canada: designers, developers, cloud engineers, compliance specialists and recruiters. Design is one of our seven practices — not the whole company. No account managers passing messages — you talk to the people doing the work.</p>
<h2>Seven practices, one team</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">Web Design &amp; Experience, Managed Hosting, Cloud &amp; Containers, AI, Compliance Readiness, Consultancy, and Staffing &amp; Talent. Each practice has its own specialists, its own page, and its own proof. Buy one, buy all seven — none requires the others.</p>
<h2>How a project team is built</h2>
<p style="max-width:760px">One designer + one developer + one strategist per website project. For cloud and compliance work, a cloud engineer + a compliance specialist + a project lead. For staffing, a named specialist embedded in your team. Small, senior, and accountable — and the same people from first call to launch.</p>
<h2>Our values</h2><div class="grid3">
<div class="card"><h3>Fast</h3><p>Every site loads in under 1.5 seconds. Speed is a feature, and it is measured, not claimed.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Honest</h3><p>Custom quotes, scoped before quoting, real timelines, real work. No fake proof, no invented results, no prices we have not settled.</p></div>
<div class="card"><h3>Yours</h3><p>Your domain, your site, your data, your cloud account. No lock-in.</p></div>
</div>
<p style="margin-top:28px"><strong>Based in Canada.</strong></p>
<p style="margin-top:16px"><a class="btn" href={BASE + "/contact"}>Contact us →</a></p>
</div></section>
</Base>
